I'm not sure about the PDP-11 version of Spacewar, but the original
version ran on the PDP-1 (starting in 1962, long before the PDP-11
was ever imagined).

Most of us don't have PDP-1s lying around (I had access to one during
the late 1970s, but it had been heavily modified).  However, about
5 years ago, some folks wrote a PDP-1 simulator in Java, and then
typed in the original PDP-1 assembly code for Spacewar, so you
can try it out yourself:

    http://lcs.www.media.mit.edu/groups/el/projects/spacewar/

and you can read the PDP-1 source code, if you really want.

-Jeff

P.S.: I can't take any credit at all for this!


