was added afters by someone ?

i'm not familiar with the RZ26F-E - i assume it's a 1G 1" high 7200rpm drive?

i don't recommend adding too much internal storage to the 255.. it gets
pretty hot and relies a lot on fan driven airflow to keep that alpha cpu
cool.

