               /  \                 | \
              B1  B2                B1  -B2
               \  /                 |     |
                B3                  B3   B3
               /  \                 | \ /  \
              B4  B5                B5 B4   B5
               \  /                 |   \  /
                B6                  B6   B6

              flow graph           superblock


